{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119591","id":3713540169,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7dWCBJ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119591","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119591.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119591.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119591","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119591/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119591/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119591/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/20f4c3f16bbebe9eda917693ea88e9cd420106b2","number":119591,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Implement and expose property hint in TileSet custom data layer","user":{"login":"poohcom1","id":74857873,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0ODU3ODcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74857873?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/poohcom1","html_url":"https://github.com/poohcom1","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poohcom1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poohcom1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poohcom1/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poohcom1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poohcom1/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poohcom1/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poohcom1/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poohcom1/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poohcom1/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14874\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/6346\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/8749\r\n\r\nThis PR implements and exposes `PropertyHint` and hint string information for custom data layers in TileSet through scripting, so that developers will be able to have greater control over the editing and validation of custom data, such as specifying enums or resource type. It introduces 4 new methods to `TileSet`; getters and setters for `hint` and `hint_string` in the same fashion as the existing `name` and `type` properties:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nset_custom_data_layer_property_hint(layer_index: int, hint: PropertyHint) -> void\r\nset_custom_data_layer_property_hint_string(layer_index: int, hint_string: String) -> void\r\n\r\nget_custom_data_layer_property_hint(layer_index: int) -> PropertyHint\r\nget_custom_data_layer_property_hint_string(layer_index: int) -> String\r\n```\r\n\r\nHere's an example of how it can be used:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/161df484-3a4b-4c88-be80-810179dbdff1\r\n\r\nIn its current state, it is best used in a custom resource class, with the setters called in `_get_property_list()` to prevent caching issues.\r\n\r\nNote that unlike `custom_data_layer_x/name` and `custom_data_layer_x/type`, hint and hint string are **not** listed in `get_property_list()` since it doesn't need to be serialized for runtime. However, this can be added later if we do implement editor features.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis is intentionally a barebones implementation; there is no attempt to make a user-friendly editor or scripting API beyond exposing the raw values. \r\n\r\nThe goal is to expose the feature for advanced users and addon creators, similar to `_validate_property()`. If addons are insufficient or if the community wants further UX improvements, further improvements could easily be built on top of this change as editor and/or scripting implementation (I go into a bit more detail in https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14874).\r\n\r\nOnce this PR is merged, I'll add further documentation as follow-ups to elaborate on how the new APIs should be used, i.e. why it should be called in `_get_property_list()` and in a tool script, etc.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"